He traveled throughout Galilee. He preached in their synagogues. He cast out demons from those who were possessed. Jesus heals a man who suffered from a skin disease.
A man who had a skin disease came to Jesus. Falling on his knees, he begged Jesus, saying, "If you are willing to make me 'clean,' you can do so."
Jesus was filled with deep concern. He reached out and touched the man. "I am willing to do this," he said. "Be 'clean'!"
He immediately recovered from his illness. He was cured.
Jesus immediately dispatched him, and he gave the man a strong warning.
"Don't tell anyone about this," he said. "Go and show yourself to the priest. Make the sacrifices that Moses commanded. He will be a witness for the priest and the people that you are 'clean'."
But the man went out and began to talk openly. He spread the news to everyone. So Jesus could no longer openly enter a town. Instead, he stayed outside in remote places. Yet people kept coming to him from everywhere.
Jesus healed a man who could not walk.
